The run's abort signal reaches every Mistral request: the raw stream
fetch and structuredOutput's chat.complete. Upstream has no signal on
either (ai-mistral 0.6.11 main); upstream PR to be opened.
Remove when an @tanstack/ai-mistral release passes the signal.

